          code: "+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n|       USER A (Sender - iPhone)                         USER B (Recipient - Web + iOS)  |\n+------------------+--------------------------------------------------+------------------+\n                   | WSS Frame: SEND_MSG                              ^ WSS Frame: NEW_MSG\n                   v                                                  |\n+----------------------------------------+          +-----------------+------------------+\n|       Chat Gateway Node 12 (Netty)     |          |       Chat Gateway Node 87 (Netty) |\n|  Local Map: {UserA_iOS -> SocketCh_1}  |          |  Local Map: {UserB_Web -> Sock_9}  |\n+------------------+---------------------+          +-----------------+------------------+\n                   |                                                  ^\n                   | 1. gRPC handleSendMessage()                      | 5. gRPC pushFrame()\n                   v                                                  |\n+---------------------------------------------------------------------+------------------+\n|                         CHAT ROUTING SERVICE FLEET (Stateless Java)                    |\n|                                                                                        |\n|  2. Generate Snowflake ID (msgId = 9018239102) & Deduplicate via clientMsgUuid         |\n|  3. Persist to Cassandra `channel_messages` (Quorum Write)                             |\n|  4. Fetch Channel Members -> Lookup Sessions in Redis -> Fan-out to Gateways or Push   |\n+---------+-----------------------------------+----------------------------------+-------+\n          |                                   |                                  |\n          | 3. Write Message                  | 4. HGETALL sess:{userB}          | 6. If Device Offline\n          v                                   v                                  v\n+-------------------------------+   +-------------------------------+   +----------------+\n|   Cassandra / ScyllaDB        |   |    Redis Session Cluster      |   |  Apache Kafka  |\n|  PK: (channel_id, bucket)     |   |  \"sess:userB\" ->              |   |  -> Push Notif |\n|  CK: message_id DESC          |   |    {\"web\": \"gw-node-87\"}      |   |  (APNs / FCM)  |\n+-------------------------------+   +-------------------------------+   +----------------+"
